# JLink GDB Server startup script for CLion
# CLion will use this to launch JLinkGDBServer
# 
# Usage: Run -> Edit Configurations -> + -> JLink GDB Server
# Settings:
#   Target: STM32F407IG
#   GDB Server: /opt/SEGGER/JLink/JLinkGDBServer (or wherever JLink is installed)
#   Executable: build/gm6020_control.elf
#   GDB: arm-none-eabi-gdb
#   Download: check "Always"
#   Run After: check "continue"
